## Section 3: Export Control Implications

**Deemed export rule applicability**: If the director is NOT a U.S. person (neither a U.S. citizen nor a U.S. permanent resident), the deemed export rule applies to any controlled technical data shared with this director. Such sharing is legally treated as an export to the director's country(ies) of nationality and may require a license from BIS (EAR) or DDTC (ITAR).

Based on Section 1 responses:

- [ ] U.S. person — deemed export rule does **not** apply
